From e5adb84d10343d63289e38dbdd68b5f61162f50b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:45:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] FORK-10 (e): damage and death of mod entities

A player's blow on a mod entity's box takes the weapon's damage (melee_damage, the kind as the target), the owner mod changes it through mod-entity-damaged (0 cancels), the entity loses that health, and at 0 the mod hears mod-entity-died and the game removes it. mod-entity-update gains health.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
